{"1979130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nix: Ashes of the Phoenix", "steam_appid": 1979130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Hold onto your hats! This game is still a tender sprout in the garden - in early access, mind you - but we're spicing it up with fresh content each week!</strong><br><br>Introducing Nix, the dauntless warrior who's got her Taoist arts down pat. She's traversed a realm that's more higgledy-piggledy than a rush-hour traffic, warding off all kinds of twisted baddies itching to claim her scalp.<br><br>But don't you worry! Armed with her trusty spellbook and a steadfast ally, Nix is all set to dance the dangerous tango!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Potent spells at your disposal<br></li><li> Spruce up your magic with spell augments<br></li><li> Buddies straight out of mythological central casting<br></li><li> Swarms of enemies just itching for a showdown<br></li><li> Buffs so robust, they'd put a bodybuilder to shame<br></li><li> Hoard gold, amp up your power, and show those villains who's boss<br></li><li> Level up, wreak havoc, and revel in the ensuing chaos<br></li><li> A host of unique bosses to battle, each within its own distinct terrain</li></ul><br>Want to chew the fat or just hang out? Swing by our Discord! ", "about_the_game": "<strong>Hold onto your hats! This game is still a tender sprout in the garden - in early access, mind you - but we're spicing it up with fresh content each week!</strong><br><br>Introducing Nix, the dauntless warrior who's got her Taoist arts down pat. She's traversed a realm that's more higgledy-piggledy than a rush-hour traffic, warding off all kinds of twisted baddies itching to claim her scalp.<br><br>But don't you worry! Armed with her trusty spellbook and a steadfast ally, Nix is all set to dance the dangerous tango!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Potent spells at your disposal<